codex
Eve supports system instructions on every model call, outside history, so compaction can’t summarize away a bot’s role. Its memory providers offer a separate recall lifecycle. The key implementation issue is binding a new session to the right bot before the first turn; the selected sidebar bot isn’t a safe fallback.

